// Sounio Standard Library: Sedenion Neural Networks (SNN)
//
// Neural network layers that operate on sedenion-valued (16D hypercomplex) data.
// Designed for parameter-efficient learning on naturally 16-dimensional data
// such as hyperspectral imaging, multi-omics, and multi-modal medical data.
//
// Key Features:
// - SedenionLayer: Dense layer with ~1/16th parameters of real equivalent
// - Zero divisor handling: Regularization to avoid algebraic singularities
// - Non-associativity aware: Consistent accumulation order in forward pass
//
// Modules:
// - sedenion_layer: Dense layers and MLP
// - pac_training: PAC-aware training with formal learning guarantees
// - benchmark: Kill switch tests comparing sedenion vs real-valued NNs
// - sedenion_similarity: Distance/similarity metrics on S^15, KG scoring
// - sedenion_backward: Cayley-Dickson adjoint gradients, layer backward
// - sedenion_optimizer: Adam & SGD for sedenion parameters (16-component)
// - sedenion_embedding: Embedding tables, KG models, epistemic scoring
// - sedenion_training: End-to-end training loop with ZD regularization
// - (planned) sedenion_conv: 2D convolution for spatial data

mod sedenion_layer
mod pac_training
mod benchmark
mod sedenion_similarity
mod sedenion_backward
mod sedenion_optimizer
mod sedenion_embedding
mod sedenion_training
